      en: 'A self-adhesive label with no siliconised liner: the adhesive sits on the web itself and the printer’s cutter sets each label’s length.', us: 'A pressure-sensitive label with no siliconized liner: the adhesive sits on the web itself and the printer’s cutter sets each label’s length.',
